1
00:00:00,227 --> 00:00:02,557
(Raj:)It looks like a map
from Dungeons & Dragons.

2
00:00:02,563 --> 00:00:04,033
(Amy:)Mm.

3
00:00:04,031 --> 00:00:07,501
(Howard:)Except the creature in the crib
is a level-nine poop monster.

4
00:00:07,501 --> 00:00:10,401
(Raj:)Okay, uh, you check
for squeaks,

5
00:00:10,404 --> 00:00:11,874
(Raj:)and I will
mark them down.

6
00:00:11,872 --> 00:00:13,172
(Bernadette:)Okay.

7
00:00:13,174 --> 00:00:16,244
(Howard:)Space A-3, here we go.

8
00:00:19,447 --> 00:00:21,817
(Howard:)It's squeaking. Mark it.

9
00:00:21,816 --> 00:00:24,646
(Raj:)It's nice to think that
you grew up in this room

10
00:00:24,652 --> 00:00:26,282
(Raj:)and now your daughter's
going to as well.

11
00:00:26,287 --> 00:00:30,127
(Howard:)Mm. I hope she has the same
amount of sex in it I did.

12
00:00:30,124 --> 00:00:31,654
(Howard:)None. Next square.

13
00:00:35,196 --> 00:00:37,366
(Raj:)Why do you bounce with your
hands in the air like that?

14
00:00:37,364 --> 00:00:40,134
(Howard:)It's a tradition of my people.

15
00:00:40,134 --> 00:00:41,864
♪ If I were a rich man ♪

16
00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:47,870
"Material Girl"
needs to be retired.

17
00:00:47,875 --> 00:00:50,405
(Raj:)That is your karaoke song.

18
00:00:53,347 --> 00:00:57,247
(Sheldon:)Would you like to play
a driving game I invented?

19
00:00:57,251 --> 00:01:01,021
(Leonard:)Is it about the failing state
of my relationship with Penny?

